lokihouse (0.9.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Retention sweeper (compactor.retention_enabled, default true);
    retention_period and retention_stream now apply to stored data.
  * Schema version 2: run lokihouse -schema.migrate once after
    upgrading, with all instances stopped (see README.Debian).
  * The ClickHouse-backed migrate test is skipped in the package build.

